        "---\n",
        "## Practical 7: Scaling and simple linear regression\n",
        "\n",
        "**Objective:** Demonstrate StandardScaler and MinMaxScaler, then train a simple linear regression model to predict `price` from one available numeric feature. The feature is selected from common Airbnb columns."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 9,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "MinMax scaled example:\n",
            " [0.         0.16666667 0.44444444 0.72222222 1.        ]\n",
            "Standard scaled example:\n",
            " [-1.28638417 -0.82696125 -0.06125639  0.70444848  1.47015334]\n",
            "Predictor: accommodates\n",
            "MAE: 30.441940204703105\n",
            "RMSE: 97.4323537677357\n",
            "R2: 0.16315283790412427\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "data": {
            "image/png": "",
            "text/plain": [
              "<Figure size 700x600 with 1 Axes>"
